{"backendEventChannel":"assistant","backendEventContent":"入力と固定スナップショットのハッシュを確認し、設計・計測方法を読み取り専用で査読します。実行中の計測やDBには触れません。","backendEventIsDelta":true,"backendEventSequence":1,"backendEventType":"agent_message_chunk","currentStepId":"sol-adversarial-review","executionId":"sol-adversarial-review-attempt-1-exec-45","nodeExecutions":1,"nodeId":"sol-adversarial-review","sessionId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol-session-15","status":"running","stepId":"sol-adversarial-review","type":"backend_event","workflowId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol"}
{"backendEventChannel":"assistant","backendEventContent":"開始時の固定マニフェストと指定15ファイルのハッシュはすべて一致しました。scale側は必須範囲と未完了を区別していますが、reqmix2側では「complete以外」を一律に上限到達として反復を省くため、2013などの予期しないエラーも省略判定に入ります。影響する主張と、既存証拠で判定できる範囲を確認します。","backendEventIsDelta":true,"backendEventSequence":2,"backendEventType":"agent_message_chunk","currentStepId":"sol-adversarial-review","executionId":"sol-adversarial-review-attempt-1-exec-45","nodeExecutions":1,"nodeId":"sol-adversarial-review","sessionId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol-session-15","status":"running","stepId":"sol-adversarial-review","type":"backend_event","workflowId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol"}
{"backendEventChannel":"assistant","backendEventContent":"reqmix2では、予期しないエラーを上限到達として数える問題に加え、1秒で終わる後続armでも、先行armの予算消費によって反復が欠け、終了コード0になり得ます。これは静的な反例で、今回の実行失敗を観測したものではありません。所有者監査で既存結果を再分類できる部分と、欠けた比較だけ補測すべき部分を分けます。","backendEventIsDelta":true,"backendEventSequence":3,"backendEventType":"agent_message_chunk","currentStepId":"sol-adversarial-review","executionId":"sol-adversarial-review-attempt-1-exec-45","nodeExecutions":1,"nodeId":"sol-adversarial-review","sessionId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol-session-15","status":"running","stepId":"sol-adversarial-review","type":"backend_event","workflowId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol"}
{"backendEventChannel":"assistant","backendEventContent":"設計判定はrejectedの方向です。修正が必要なのは、reqmix2のエラー分類、必須armの範囲・予算判定、中断後の終了確認です。scaleの30ケース計画、上限、到着数の保存、raw保存形式は静的に確認できました。全ラボの再実行を一律には求めず、既存証拠の再分類、主張の限定、不足する比較だけの補測で対応できる範囲を示します。","backendEventIsDelta":true,"backendEventSequence":4,"backendEventType":"agent_message_chunk","currentStepId":"sol-adversarial-review","executionId":"sol-adversarial-review-attempt-1-exec-45","nodeExecutions":1,"nodeId":"sol-adversarial-review","sessionId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol-session-15","status":"running","stepId":"sol-adversarial-review","type":"backend_event","workflowId":"temp-table-count-protocol-sol"}
